message: "If you use or discuss this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Nomadology Visualizer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Culp
    given-names: Andrew
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-18"
url: "https://nomad-viz.vercel.app"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/minor-science/nomad-viz"
abstract: >-
  Interactive physical simulations of the machinic processes in Gilles Deleuze
  and Félix Guattari's A Thousand Plateaus. Four models (crystals, a liquid,
  sound, gravity) each stage capture, the war machine, and warding off as the
  behavior of one material, with lines of flight between them. Each model
  separates what the book says, what it borrows, the physics it runs, and where
  they part ways.
keywords:
  - Deleuze
  - Guattari
  - nomadology
  - A Thousand Plateaus
  - smooth and striated space
  - war machine
  - apparatus of capture
  - simulation
  - visualization
